EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}We'll play {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}once{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} and lay it all on the
line! If we throw out the same thing,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
it's a do-over, OK?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ready?

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Nos lo jugamos todo a {{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}una ronda{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}!
Si los dos sacamos lo mismo,{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
repetimos, ¿vale?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} ¿Estás list{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}}?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Tek el{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}} oynayıp her şeyi ortaya koyuyoruz!
Aynısını seçersek{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
yeniden oynarız, tamam mı?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Hazır mısın?
